# INVWIN7.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: new locations.
# INS on Office shows a new location inside it, Inside showing Office's
# code and path and Type the type of the first location already in
# Office; OK without a name is refused at Name; a name used beside it
# is refused by the server, its message under the fields and the focus
# on Name; a code that exists is refused at Code; a negative capacity
# is refused at Capacity; mended, the location is added, the tree
# fetched again from its start with it selected.  INS on Shelf C3, which
# holds no location, leaves Type empty.  Locations > New location over
# the item list shows a new location at the top level, a Room, which
# ESC leaves untouched without asking.  Five locations added one inside
# the other below Box B2 reach the eighth level, where Ins is refused at
# once; the eighth coded L8, Shelf C3's Inside typed L8 is refused under
# the fields as it is left and again by OK, and Record > Move from Shelf
# C3 into it in a message box, the tree unchanged; the end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWIN7.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-L B
K INS
S NEW
K ENTER
S NONAME
T Shelf A1
K ENTER
S DUP
T Shelf C3
K ALT-C
T A1
K ENTER
S DUPCODE
T C3
K ALT-P
T -1
K ENTER
S NEGCAP
K BS BS
T 12
K ENTER
S ADDED
K END INS
S NOTYPE
K ESC ESC ALT-L N
S MENUNEW
K ESC
S MENUESC
# five levels below Box B2, the eighth the deepest: Ins there refused
K ALT-L B
T B
K INS
T Level 4
K ALT-T
T BOX
K ENTER
K INS
T Level 5
K ALT-T
T BOX
K ENTER
K INS
T Level 6
K ALT-T
T BOX
K ENTER
K INS
T Level 7
K ALT-T
T BOX
K ENTER
K INS
T Level 8
K ALT-T
T BOX
K ENTER
S DEEPEST
K INS
S TOODEEP
K ENTER
S NOTADDED
# Level 8 coded L8: Shelf C3's Inside typed L8 is refused as the field
# is left and again by OK; Move of Shelf C3 into Level 8 is refused too
K CTRL-E ALT-C
T L8
K ENTER
S CODED
T S
S ONC3
K CTRL-E ALT-I
T L8
K TAB
S FORMDEEP
K ENTER
S FORMSTOP
K ESC
S DROPQ
K Y
S DROPPED
K ALT-C M
T LLLLL
S PICKL8
K ENTER
S MOVEDEEP
K ENTER
S NOTMOVED
K ALT-F X
